From: Marina Kuzminchuk <marina.a.kuzminchuk@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:25:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] =?UTF-8?q?feat:=20straight-forward=20=E2=80=94=20forw?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ard=20text=20messages=20and=20gallery=20images?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Long-press the send button on a text message → "Forward" opens multi-peer
selection pre-checked to the current chat peer.

Attaching images via the gallery tab exposes a Forward button on the
attachment panel; long-pressing the send button inside the full-screen
gallery view also shows "Forward" in the context menu.

Auto-hides the "Forwarded from:" label when all forwarded messages belong
to the current user (no "Forwarded from: you").

Fixes a duplicate Saved Messages entry in the forward sheet that arose
because PeerSelectionControllerNode.beginSelection() was inserting
preselected peers into foundPeers (which the chat list renders as a
separate pinned row) in addition to selectedPeerIds/selectedPeerMap.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
